                </terminology_id>
                <code_string>en</code_string>
            </language>
            <purpose>Example template for educational purposes, see some background and swedish instructions at https://github.com/modellbibliotek/kurs-openEHR-jan-2021 and partially translated to english at https://github.com/modellbibliotek/kurs-openEHR-jan-2021/blob/main/readme.english.md.
After those were written the "motionslopp" archetype a been slightly reworked and renamed to "Sport event".</purpose>
        </details>
